  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2027, the government has strengthened systems and institutional capacities to implement policies and finance actions that ensure Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) services are safely managed, climate-resilient, sustainable, gender-responsive and equitable.</narrative>
  </description>
